      </div>
      <div class="topbar-right">
        <button class="avatar-btn" onclick="gotoPage('settings')"><span id="topAvatar">W</span><span class="status-dot"></span></button>
        <button class="logout-btn" onclick="logout()">Logout</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-view active" id="page-dashboard">
      <div class="balance-card">
        <div class="balance-label">WCCoin Balance</div>
        <div class="balance-amount">
          <div class="coin-icon"><img id="coinIconMain" src="" alt="WCCoin"></div>
          <span id="mainBalance">0</span>
          <small>WCCoin</small>
        </div>
        <div class="balance-sub"><span id="balanceSub"> သင္ရဲ႕ လက္က်န္ WCCoin</span></div>
        <div class="balance-actions">
          <button class="balance-action" onclick="gotoPage('play')"> Play Slot</button>
          <button class="balance-action" onclick="gotoPage('gift')"> Gift Shop</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-box sb-total"><div class="sb-head"><div class="sb-icon"></div></div><div class="sb-label">Total WCCoin</div><div class="sb-value"><div class="inline-coin"><img class="coin-icon-mini" src=""></div><span id="statTotal">0</span><small>WCCoin</small></div><div class="sb-foot">သင့္ရဲ႕ စုစုေပါင္း</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box sb-wc"><div class="sb-head"><div class="sb-icon"></div></div><div class="sb-label">Today's Earned</div><div class="sb-value"><div class="inline-coin"><img class="coin-icon-mini" src=""></div><span id="statToday">0</span><small>WCCoin</small></div><div class="sb-foot">ယေန႕ ရရွိမႈ</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box sb-wave"><div class="sb-head"><div class="sb-icon"></div></div><div class="sb-label">Games Played</div><div class="sb-value"><span id="statGames">0</span><small>Games</small></div><div class="sb-foot">ကစားခဲ့သည့္ အေရအတြက္</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box sb-kpay"><div class="sb-head"><div class="sb-icon"></div></div><div class="sb-label">Total Wins</div><div class="sb-value"><div class="inline-coin"><img class="coin-icon-mini" src=""></div><span id="statWins">0</span><small>WCCoin</small></div><div class="sb-foot">စုစုေပါင္း အနိုင္ရမႈ</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="action-grid">
        <button class="action-tile at-play" onclick="gotoPage('play')"><div class="at-icon"></div><h4>Play Slot</h4><p>WCCoin ရယူပါ</p></button>
        <button class="action-tile at-gift" onclick="gotoPage('gift')"><div class="at-icon"></div><h4>Gift Shop</h4><p>လက္ေဆာင္ လဲလွယ္</p></button>
        <button class="action-tile at-receive" onclick="gotoPage('transfer')"><div class="at-icon"></div><h4>Transfer</h4><p>WCCoin လႊဲပို႔</p></button>
        <button class="action-tile at-history" onclick="gotoPage('buy')"><div class="at-icon"></div><h4>Buy WCCoin</h4><p>ပိုက္ဆံနဲ႕ ဝယ္</p></button>
      </div>

      <div class="wallets-section">
        <div class="section-header"><h3> Wallets</h3></div>
        <div class="wallet-cards" id="walletCards"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-view" id="page-play">
      <div class="slot-wrapper">
        <div class="slot-top">
          <div class="slot-credit"><div class="coin-icon"><img class="coin-icon-credit" src=""></div><span class="lbl">WCCoin</span><span class="val" id="slotCredit">0</span></div>
          <div class="slot-top-right">
            <button class="slot-btn-sm" onclick="refreshSlot()" title="Refresh"></button>
            <button class="slot-btn-sm" onclick="gotoPage('dashboard')" title="Back"></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="slot-title">SLOT</div>
        <div class="slot-subtitle">WCCoin  55  WIN <span id="slotWinRateLabel">40</span>%</div>
        <div class="slot-info-row">
          <div class="slot-info-item"><div class="lbl">BET</div><div class="val" id="slotBetDisplay">10</div></div>
          <div class="slot-info-item"><div class="lbl">WIN</div><div class="val" id="slotWinDisplay">0</div></div>
          <div class="slot-info-item vip"><div class="lbl">VIP</div><div class="val" id="slotVipDisplay"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="slot-main">
          <div class="slot-ways"><span>55</span></div>
          <div class="slot-reels" id="slotReels">
            <div class="reels-frame">
              <div class="reels-container" id="reelsContainer"></div>
              <div class="slot-effect" id="slotEffect"></div>
              <div class="slot-freespin" id="slotFreeSpin"></div>
